    "virtual": {
        "about": "A visit is virtual (Column B2) when any of these is on it. The manual's list (page 60): telehealth CPT and HCPCS codes, modifier 95 or 93, place of service 02. Added here, marked so they can be checked: place of service 10 (telehealth in the patient's home, introduced after the manual's list was written) and OpenEMR's encounter class VR (Virtual Encounter).",
