    "substanceUseDiagnoses": {
        "about": "A mental health or substance use disorder visit is a substance use disorder visit (Line 21) when its first diagnosis is one of these, and a mental health visit otherwise (pages 54-55: classify by the primary service, not the provider's title). The codes are Table 6A's Lines 18 (alcohol-related disorders) and 19 (other substance-related disorders, excluding tobacco use disorders), copied from data/table-6a.json in the same notation.",
